d region to a file\n+    outside the repo rather than to stdout, so it cannot be swept into an\n+    agent transcript. Today the only route is `cledger export` piped\n+    through a hand-written filter.\n+  `scripts/inspect-finding.py` is a throwaway prototype of the last two,\n+  kept only as reference for whoever implements this properly.\n - Whether an explicit `Conversation` manifest object earns its keep once\n   multiple producers exist.","is_error":false,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SZKetnqhjKLxtGqB19UGeb","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","dirty_fingerprint":"bbe20560a71a254635cbd033aa353a00fbd2c3fb094525003f36b4423871768b","head":"183e3e0941068e8524d568b98297e3439d058c1f","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:cef69ec2-8b5a-4e91-8078-ac955e039295","seq":939},"id":"ev1-cf4c32f878f93416bfe0e960e1a69baebc3601cdfff7c81d7f0764acf76e260f","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-28T06:38:05.009Z","producer":{"session_id":"cef69ec2-8b5a-4e91-8078-ac955e039295","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.220","tool":"cledger","version":"0.13.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"content":"diff --git a/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md b/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\nindex fe10ebb..35f397c 100644\n--- a/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\n+++ b/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md\n@@ -480,5 +480,32 @@ for now (see the format-drift roadmap item).\n   (the full system prompt), sandbox/approval policy, reasoning effort — is\n   still uncaptured. Whether whole-session configuration belongs in the\n   ledger at all, and under which kind, is its own question.\n+- **Scan findings are not inspectable enough to act on** (reported\n+  2026-07-27 while dogfooding turnbridge). `formatFinding` prints ~20\n+  character